<title>FRANCE: S&amp;P confirms Unibail LT, ST ratings.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P confirms Unibail LT, ST ratings.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's said on Tuesday it was confirming the long term A- rating on Unibail's first tier debt and raising the outlook to positive from stable.</p>
<p>S&amp;P also said it confirmed the A-2 rating on Unibail's short term certificates of deposit.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said it based its decision on the solidity of Unibail's competitive position and its strong presence in the large shopping centre sector which S&amp;P said it considers good security in credit matters.</p>
<p>--  Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
